@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@receptions = {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions
@expenses = {{receptions}}/general-expenses
@GAdate = 2025-12-31
@reference = GAW-PRUEBA-A
@supplierId = 719
@bankAccountId = 6610
@expenseId = 7910000000000
@paymentRevision = 1

### Preparar Gastos múltiples
GET {{expenses}}/create

### Resolver códigos del ejemplo local
GET {{expenses}}/catalog?supplierCode=000043&productCode=6003402005

### Registrar un GA en la base de pruebas
# Usa una referencia y una clave UUID disponibles.
POST {{expenses}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "a5acd018-4df2-4e3a-8ab5-1aaaf52cb70c",
  "date": "{{GAdate}}",
  "reference": "{{reference}}",
  "beneficiary": "PROVEEDOR DE PRUEBA",
  "description": "Gasto GA de prueba",
  "taxAccounts": { "vat": "1119001" },
  "lines": [
    {
      "supplierCode": "000043",
      "productCode": "6003402005",
      "reference": "{{reference}}",
      "base": 100,
      "vat": 16,
      "vatWithholding": 0,
      "incomeWithholding": 0,
      "costCenter": "1"
    }
  ]
}

### Abrir el documento y su auxiliar con el ID devuelto
GET {{receptions}}/{{expenseId}}

###
GET {{receptions}}/{{expenseId}}/actions/auxiliary

### Saldo del proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/balance

### Preparar el pago con el mismo ID del documento
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{expenseId}}

### Registrar un pago parcial PP con la revisión devuelta
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/payments/{{expenseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "d7f6881a-35c9-4045-a08b-52769093e826",
  "revision": {{paymentRevision}},
  "bankAccountId": {{bankAccountId}},
  "mode": "transfer",
  "amount": 30,
  "date": "{{GAdate}}",
  "description": "Pago parcial de GA de prueba"
}
